cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "low-input-nanopore: enrichment analysis for depletion-mode adaptive sampling nanopore sequencing"
abstract: >-
  A Nextflow pipeline that quantifies how much depletion-mode adaptive sampling
  enriches low-input sample DNA sequenced against a lambda genomic carrier on
  Oxford Nanopore. Reads are assigned competitively against a combined
  reference holding the community, the carrier, and the E. coli contaminant
  carried over from lambda production, so that every read is accounted for
  exactly once and enrichment is computed against an exact denominator.
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CarrCE/low-input-nanopore"
url: "https://github.com/CarrCE/low-input-nanopore"
